      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A wonderful opportunity to acquire a traditional two bedroom semi-detached cottage, ideally situated in the heartland of Coleman Country. The property is in need of total refurbishment, offering prospective purchasers an exciting opportunity to restore and transform this charming cottage into a wonderful home or investment property.\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, kitchen, spacious sitting room, two generously proportioned double bedrooms, shower room and separate WC. Externally, the property stands on a generous site extending to approximately half an acre, providing excellent potential for landscaping, outdoor living and further development, subject to the relevant permissions.\nThis property may also qualify for the Derelict Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the relevant terms and conditions. An appealing proposition for those seeking a traditional cottage with significant refurbishment potential in a desirable rural setting.\n\n\nServices \nMains water.\nSeptic tank on site.\nElectric connected."
